{"id":"5f416232f97c2d5f439f76c13d3ccdf6c3bff228","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246664","title":"Claude 一条龙服务？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"ryuichisaikun","excerpt":"Claude - @ryuichisaikun - 看到最近很多人吐槽 Claude 封号，但是我自己稳定用了几年一直没有被封号，包括前几天领取 claude 送的 250 刀额度我也直接领了没有任何影响，所以如果我提供一个服务，让你的机器保持和我的机","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>看到最近很多人吐槽 Claude 封号，但是我自己稳定用了几年一直没有被封号，包括前几天领取 claude 送的 250 刀额度我也直接领了没有任何影响，所以如果我提供一个服务，让你的机器保持和我的机器相同的配置，包括机场商家、使用的节点、分流的规则（我告诉你你来充值配置），另外，支付我可以帮你创建 App Store 美区账户来给你充值（我来充值），让这些变量保持一致，不知道有没有人愿意付费？<br>\n当然，封号的逻辑可能会一直在变，所以我也没法完全保证通过这种方式不会被封号，如果封号退款了我可以退给你，但是如果没有退款，那就没办法了。如果愿意承担这部分风险的可以来。</p>\n<p>附一张机场的检测图：\n<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iz3pkYP.png\"></p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-10-07 11:55:33 +08:00\">8h 10m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <p>不用联系了，暂时无法跑通</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150681\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7b1432fd9577a14116e3971df74c876b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"giter\" data-uid=\"476845\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/giter\">giter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 19:38:04 +08:00\">1 day ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>得了吧，哪有什么稳定变量，按照你的这套环境我生存了两年半都没事，最终还不是封号了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150683\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e2a12e5d0a4557f268c2a13f81a4cc58?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ryuichisaikun\" data-uid=\"761785\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ryuichisaikun\">ryuichisaikun</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 19:41:59 +08:00\">1 day ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/giter\">giter</a> #1 1.注意审题，我并没有说是稳定变量。<br>2.如果是两年半才封，那相比刚订阅就封号的，这样不已经算是很稳定了吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150699\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c4ecbd96390b93e2a2d7bc95d422354e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Mzs\" data-uid=\"210721\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Mzs\">Mzs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 20:06:10 +08:00\">23h 59m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>其实是幸存者偏差</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150701\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f6d728141d880c96ef399e57ae56b339?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"obiah666\" data-uid=\"573483\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/obiah666\">obiah666</a></strong> &#160; &#16