18150732\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c7/f37f/12555_normal.png?m=1749107530\" alt=\"x86\" data-uid=\"12555\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/x86\">x86</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 20:41:18 +08:00\">23h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>666 还有人迷信 IP</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150737\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/aa2d96f5f80a0e9973095cbbf973e8c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Hanmi\" data-uid=\"777850\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Hanmi\">Hanmi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 20:48:22 +08:00\">23h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没用，又没法保证永远不封，有这钱不如花在办合规信用卡或者租点 ip 够干净的 vps / 家宽上呢，基本各大家宽群里的用户大部分帐户存续时间都挺长的（排除 nat 用户），不脏不折腾反代之类的本来就不容易秒封，我这有个号今年 1 月份 giffgaff 卡+ 英国伪装家宽注册的（ zorocloud ）直接绑的 fiat24 还活着呢... （按说这种 U 卡应该很容易封号的），后面六月份吧应该是 giffgaff 开始封禁大陆用户了我就没再登陆和续费了，现在还总给我邮箱发推送邮件呢... 其实感觉别用万人骑和有前科的 ip ，支付方式保险起见别碰 虚拟卡/u 卡/prepaid 卡，套一层对应地区的 apple store/ google play / paypal ，有条件直接上该地区的 debit / credit 卡直接绑， 注册的邮箱、设备、ip 、付款方式没前科，基本上都能活挺久的了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150741\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/78c77545c7347c733c6bcf011e47592a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Aestas16\" data-uid=\"642688\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Aestas16\">Aestas16</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 20:52:59 +08:00\">23h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你真的要搞的话，我愿意试试，报个价吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150753\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5cdbe7086c74dff5d9c4b65d2de13ae4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mangmaimu\" data-uid=\"686821\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mangmaimu\">mangmaimu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 21:02:17 +08:00\">23h 3m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>到时候连坐就好玩了😂自己都用不了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150783\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/de4f/7ef0/464595_normal.png?m=1597214371\" alt=\"yuxian\" data-uid=\"464595\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuxian\">yuxian</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 21:24:32 +08:00\">22h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我此前想过这个问题，但发现商业价值太低了。Claude 的开放，只是时间问题。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18150787\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e2a12e5d0a4557f268c2a13f81a4cc58?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ryuichisaikun\" data-uid=\"761785\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n  